 "differences": [
  "The deposit and the published paper's analysed samples (14 per experiment) agree with the preprint (PsyArXiv e32fv, read in place of the journal text, which was not reachable); the preprint's Wilcoxon z values for the later-range change in Experiment 3 (-2.66, -2.05, -3.44) were not reproduced from the rows (-3.4, -2.6, -3.6 for the mean of bars 51-55 against 1820 ms), so only counts and the nominal bar length are used as published checks.",
  "In the authors' barlength_ratio_exp3 file, two later-range values (the last participant's trial 2 in conditions B and D) read 0.765 and 0.739, while the deposit's bar lengths for those trials give 0.956 and 0.924; the other 278 values of that file, and all values of the Experiment 1 and 2 files, are reproduced from the rows."
 ],
